# The city itself is the killer here, not bad luck. North from the
# arrival corner walks into a scripted ambush (a grizzled man with a
# club; you wake up at Main & Wicker), and south from THERE is
# Buxton/Briggs territory -- "Outsiders will be killed on sight" --
# where the tribe binds you for the bonfire. No amount of waiting
# reschedules either one. The tour below never gives them the
# chance: sign, grocery, bridge, out, staying one scene ahead of
# the dog pack you can hear closing from the east. Five scenes bank
# 24 of the 43 points on offer in 2081, and the endgame gate (read
# from the debug block at prism.zil:2123) needs all four decades
# over minimums: 2051 > 10, 2061 > 20, 2071 > 40, 2081 > 14. The
# 2071 tour survived its attack with 56 banked, so this clears the
# last bar with room to spare. One vocabulary trap: the sack is
# "blood-soaked," but the parser has never heard the word "bloody."

read sign
sw
eat mold
ne. e
examine sack
record off
abort

peof

